    "sections": {
        "description": "A block theme for record shops and second-hand music dealers: vinyl, CD, cassettes and merchandise. Covers take center stage, sections and the artist index look like the dividers of a record bin, and prices sit on round stickers. Works on its own for a shop blog and pages; pair it with the Wax Store Catalog plugin for the catalog, filters, grading and copies for sale."
